---
<div id="tutorial-modal" class="modal-overlay">
  <div class="modal-content tutorial-card">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <h2 class="modal-title">💡 How to Play BoxBattle</h2>
      <button id="close-tutorial-btn" class="close-btn">&times;</button>
    </div>

    <div class="tutorial-body">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="tutorial-step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <h3>Take Turns Drawing Lines</h3>
          <p>Click or tap between two adjacent dots to draw a horizontal or vertical line.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="tutorial-step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <h3>Claim Boxes & Get Extra Turns</h3>
          <p>Draw the <strong>fourth side</strong> of a 1x1 box to claim it! You earn 1 point and <strong>immediately get another turn</strong>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="tutorial-step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <div class="step-text">
          <h3>Master the Chain Strategy</h3>
          <p>Avoid placing the 3rd line on any box so you don't hand your opponent a free box! Force them to open up a chain of boxes for you to sweep.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-footer">
      <button id="got-it-btn" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">
        Got it! Let's Play
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .tutorial-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .modal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .modal-title {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .close-btn {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .close-btn:hover {
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .tutorial-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .tutorial-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: var(--player1-color);
    color: #000;
    font-weight: 900;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-text h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .step-text p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
</style>
